{
  "notes": [
    "The hosted sandbox demo dataset (issue #3045). scripts/sandbox/reseed.sh walks",
    "this file and drives the PUBLIC REST API only, so a green seed run is itself",
    "evidence that the deployment serves what it claims. Adding content means",
    "editing this file plus a body under scripts/sandbox/seed/, never the walker.",
    "",
    "What one run loads, in about 592 requests: 17 ADL 1.4 operational templates",
    "(the curated CKM pack plus one terminology-binding template), 230 artefacts out of the 322-file vendored ADL 2",
    "archetype corpus, 8 ADL 2 artefacts of this repository's own, 8 EHRs carrying",
    "167 ADL 1.4 + 16 ADL 2 compositions, 6 further COMPOSITION versions, 2",
    "further EHR_STATUS versions, 11 demographic parties, a directory in every",
    "EHR, and 5 stored AQL queries. One marker EHR records completion, so a second",
    "run exits immediately and the instance data is never doubled.",
    "",
    "The archetype-library pin (230 accepted / 92 refused) holds for the sandbox's",
    "terminology posture: FerroTERM beside the CDR serving the SNOMED CT",
    "International Edition and LOINC (#3304). 90 refusals are AOM2 validity",
    "(adjudicated per file in crates/openehr-adl/tests/it/ckm_archetype_packs.rs);",
    "two more follow from the served LOINC (#3315, #4278), the files adl2.",
    "archetype_library.loinc.refused_when_served names: braden_scale binds the",
    "mistyped LA9605-4 (LA9605-2 is the real code, bound beside it), which is VETDF,",
    "and braden_scale-child then has no stored parent (VASID). The source defect is",
    "the 2013 CKM's, kept verbatim. A CDR with no LOINC-serving terminology server",
    "cannot verify the binding, warns, and stores both (232 / 90; AOM2 VETDF:",
    "\"subject to tool accessibility\"). The walker asks the CDR for the loinc.probe",
    "code before the library step and refuses a posture that serves no LOINC; a",
    "local run without LOINC sets SANDBOX_TERMINOLOGY=without-loinc and expects",
    "232 / 90. The same test file checks both splits against this pin.",
    "",
    "Measured 2026-09-02 against the composed quickstart stack on an 8-CPU/8 GB",
    "Docker VM: 39-45 s from an empty schema, under a second on a second run. The",
    "loaded data is ~9 MB of canonical composition JSON and leaves a 24 MB",
    "database (17 373 node rows, 227 versions).",
    "",
    "Placeholders in the body files are substituted by the walker: __SUBJECT_ID__",
    "(an EHR subject, or under an IHE identity source the pseudonym FerroPIX minted",
    "for it), __SUBJECT_NS__ (subject_namespace, or the pseudonym domain), __PERFORMER__ / __SOURCE__ / __TARGET__ (a seeded party's",
    "VERSIONED_OBJECT uid), __COMPOSITION_n__ (the n-th composition committed into",
    "the EHR the folder is written to), and __EHR_n__ (the n-th seeded EHR id) in",
    "stored-query verification parameters."
  ],

